WEBVTT

00:00.760 --> 00:03.560
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.560 --> 00:06.150
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.820 --> 00:10.220
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.920 --> 00:14.930
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.300 --> 00:17.830
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.170 --> 00:21.610
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.360 --> 00:28.580
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.260 --> 00:34.340
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.140 --> 00:37.630
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.630 --> 00:40.240
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.760 --> 00:48.020
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.990 --> 00:51.750
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.810 --> 00:54.650
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.940 --> 00:55.970
♪Let me♪

00:56.160 --> 01:00.240
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.690 --> 01:03.370
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.660 --> 01:06.360
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.530 --> 01:08.000
♪Hands held tight♪

01:08.000 --> 01:12.170
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.530 --> 01:22.780
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.210 --> 01:29.760
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.960 --> 01:33.110
=Episode 21=

01:36.030 --> 01:37.350
Here comes our female general!

01:37.350 --> 01:38.340
- Welcome.
- Come on.

01:38.340 --> 01:39.310
- Have a seat.
- Come on.

01:39.310 --> 01:40.150
Come on, sit.

01:40.229 --> 01:41.310
- Come on.
- Take a seat.

01:41.870 --> 01:43.630
- Alright, let's sit.
- Over here.

01:43.630 --> 01:44.470
Sit here.

01:44.509 --> 01:45.590
Thank you.

01:46.190 --> 01:47.430
Now that I've seen you,

01:47.750 --> 01:49.470
I can boast to my friends.

01:49.830 --> 01:50.670
I didn't know

01:50.870 --> 01:52.229
I had become so popular.

01:52.310 --> 01:53.430
This is nothing.

01:53.710 --> 01:54.830
People on the street

01:55.110 --> 01:56.470
will shower you with flowers.

01:56.910 --> 01:58.190
Nowadays in Jiyang,

01:58.670 --> 01:59.990
the one most admired

01:59.990 --> 02:00.990
is Her Highness,

02:01.310 --> 02:02.150
and the second

02:02.230 --> 02:03.070
would be you.

02:03.070 --> 02:03.950
- Exactly.
- Yeah.

02:04.270 --> 02:06.270
But Her Highness is above us,

02:06.390 --> 02:07.670
while you're among us,

02:07.670 --> 02:09.830
which makes us believe

02:09.830 --> 02:12.190
that women can achieve greatness, too.

02:13.310 --> 02:14.150
You ladies

02:14.150 --> 02:15.430
are no less capable than men.

02:15.830 --> 02:17.030
You may not have fought

02:17.270 --> 02:19.310
on the frontline, but your deeds

02:19.550 --> 02:21.350
boosted our morale tremendously.

02:21.750 --> 02:23.430
We simply did small things

02:23.470 --> 02:24.870
under the protection

02:25.220 --> 02:27.150
of frontline warriors like you.

02:27.590 --> 02:28.550
It's nothing.

02:29.510 --> 02:31.190
No deed is too small.

02:31.190 --> 02:32.470
Everyone has their strengths.

02:32.710 --> 02:34.430
As long as we act with benevolence

02:34.590 --> 02:36.070
and righteousness,

02:36.350 --> 02:37.390
we all deserve respect.

02:38.030 --> 02:38.870
Besides,

02:38.870 --> 02:39.710
women enjoy

02:39.829 --> 02:40.990
a higher status in Jiyang

02:41.310 --> 02:42.710
thanks to Her Highness.

02:43.070 --> 02:43.910
You ladies must

02:43.950 --> 02:45.670
showcase your talents even more.

02:45.950 --> 02:46.790
You're right.

02:46.910 --> 02:48.430
I've always wanted

02:48.630 --> 02:50.030
to take the imperial exam.

02:50.310 --> 02:52.030
But I never took the exam,

02:52.070 --> 02:53.190
for fear of being judged.

02:53.550 --> 02:55.590
Next year, I'll give it a try

02:55.710 --> 02:56.829
to leave no regrets.

02:57.550 --> 02:59.630
I wish you success in the exams.

03:00.430 --> 03:01.830
A general and a scholar.

03:02.030 --> 03:02.910
I admire you.

03:03.230 --> 03:04.070
Meanwhile, I only

03:04.070 --> 03:05.150
want to do business.

03:05.830 --> 03:08.110
Most look down on merchants,

03:08.630 --> 03:09.910
but merchants can

03:10.070 --> 03:10.910
sustain themselves.

03:14.350 --> 03:15.670
Exquisite embroidery.

03:17.430 --> 03:19.270
That's Min'er's starting fund.

03:19.390 --> 03:20.510
That's why she did her best.

03:20.790 --> 03:21.750
Don't listen to her.

03:21.910 --> 03:23.310
Miss Wang is getting married.

03:23.620 --> 03:25.390
We're making small items for her.

03:25.990 --> 03:26.829
However,

03:26.829 --> 03:28.150
the groom's embroidered pouch

03:28.390 --> 03:29.510
is hers to make.

03:30.110 --> 03:31.870
Every stitch carries her affection.

03:32.310 --> 03:34.150
We mustn't do it for her.

03:34.829 --> 03:35.670
Miss Yan,

03:36.590 --> 03:37.990
I want to make a pouch too.

03:38.550 --> 03:39.670
Would you teach me?

03:40.790 --> 03:42.710
It's for General Fengyun, isn't it?

03:46.470 --> 03:47.790
Let's teach our general.

03:47.790 --> 03:49.470
- Yeah.
- Let's teach her.

03:49.750 --> 03:51.270
- Come on.
- Let me show you.

03:51.270 --> 03:53.470
Insert the needle from below upwards.

03:53.640 --> 03:54.480
Like this.

04:19.630 --> 04:20.470
Done.

04:21.470 --> 04:22.590
Let's see.

04:23.550 --> 04:24.390
Let's see.

04:36.350 --> 04:38.150
Needlework takes practice.

04:38.390 --> 04:39.430
- Yeah.
- I can teach you

04:39.750 --> 04:40.630
step by step.

04:40.909 --> 04:41.750
Yeah.

04:44.270 --> 04:45.110
What about this?

04:50.030 --> 04:50.870
Well...

04:50.870 --> 04:52.510
If it's not working,

04:52.830 --> 04:53.990
we can try something else.

04:54.590 --> 04:56.270
How about cooking?

04:56.870 --> 04:58.790
General Fengyun would be deeply moved

04:58.990 --> 05:00.590
if you cooked for him in person.

05:01.270 --> 05:02.150
But

05:02.510 --> 05:04.470
I've never cooked before.

05:04.830 --> 05:07.150
I can't just make plain porridge.

05:09.390 --> 05:10.550
Make some plain noodles.

05:10.830 --> 05:11.790
That's the easiest.

05:12.430 --> 05:13.470
Yeah, plain noodles.

05:13.790 --> 05:14.630
We can teach you

05:14.750 --> 05:15.590
all the recipes.

05:15.870 --> 05:16.790
Give it a try.

05:16.830 --> 05:17.670
Yeah.

05:17.670 --> 05:18.950
- You got this.
- You got this.

05:18.950 --> 05:19.870
- Try it.
- Come on.

05:20.030 --> 05:20.870
Yeah.

05:31.630 --> 05:32.470
Commander.

05:33.870 --> 05:35.150
You've been sorting out

05:35.270 --> 05:36.909
Jiyang's military affairs for days.

05:37.070 --> 05:38.270
You must have been tired.

05:38.390 --> 05:39.470
I can't starve you.

05:40.870 --> 05:41.710
Commander, look.

05:42.230 --> 05:44.950
I made the noodles myself.

05:45.270 --> 05:47.110
Commander, please do me a favor

05:47.750 --> 05:48.590
and try it.

05:49.230 --> 05:50.070
Please.

05:51.270 --> 05:52.350
Why did you want to cook?

05:54.230 --> 05:56.950
I just wanted to do something for you.

06:18.430 --> 06:20.270
(How much salt did you put in this?)

06:22.910 --> 06:23.750
Commander.

06:23.750 --> 06:24.590
Is it good?

06:27.750 --> 06:28.590
Yeah.

06:30.350 --> 06:31.510
Seems like I have

06:31.550 --> 06:33.550
some talent in cooking, more or less.

06:51.510 --> 06:53.150
Seeing you enjoy it so much,

06:53.510 --> 06:54.510
I'm getting hungry.

06:55.110 --> 06:55.950
Let me...

07:09.110 --> 07:09.950
You were saying...?

07:10.590 --> 07:11.430
No...

07:14.430 --> 07:15.270
Nothing.

07:20.830 --> 07:22.030
If you like it so much,

07:22.310 --> 07:23.630
I'll make more tomorrow.

07:57.190 --> 07:58.030
What's wrong?

07:58.670 --> 08:00.390
I'm checking for holes.

08:00.710 --> 08:01.630
If there are any,

08:01.830 --> 08:03.150
I can mend them.

08:08.270 --> 08:10.070
I don't think it's torn anywhere.

08:14.030 --> 08:15.270
Commander, I'll head back.

08:15.350 --> 08:16.190
Rest early.

08:33.070 --> 08:33.909
Commander.

08:34.590 --> 08:35.990
Did you hear

08:36.710 --> 08:37.830
a tearing sound?

08:48.190 --> 08:49.030
No.

08:49.950 --> 08:50.790
No?

08:57.670 --> 08:59.190
How did my sleeve get torn?

09:10.950 --> 09:12.030
Yeah, it's torn.

09:12.310 --> 09:13.390
Hurry and take it off.

09:14.510 --> 09:15.470
Come on.

09:15.670 --> 09:16.510
What...?

09:16.510 --> 09:17.670
Is it necessary?

09:18.110 --> 09:19.390
It's fine. Take it off.

09:19.390 --> 09:20.870
No need, seriously.

09:20.950 --> 09:21.790
Take it off.

09:29.150 --> 09:29.990
Do you think

09:30.120 --> 09:32.010
he misunderstood something?

09:34.110 --> 09:35.270
Why is he so flustered?

09:47.870 --> 09:48.710
What's the rush?

09:49.110 --> 09:49.950
Is something wrong?

09:51.750 --> 09:52.590
Commander.

09:52.630 --> 09:53.470
Chai Anxi woke up.

10:31.190 --> 10:32.030
Mr. Chai.

10:32.750 --> 10:33.910
When Wutuo attacked Jiyang,

10:34.350 --> 10:35.830
you could've fled amid the chaos,

10:36.590 --> 10:37.510
yet you stayed,

10:38.120 --> 10:39.990
showing a resolve to protect the people.

10:40.750 --> 10:41.590
But why

10:41.870 --> 10:43.070
did you betray my father

10:44.190 --> 10:45.030
and Wei?

10:47.110 --> 10:48.110
I didn't betray Wei.

10:49.790 --> 10:51.030
I never betrayed Wei.

10:53.710 --> 10:54.990
I didn't expect it.

10:56.550 --> 10:58.470
I just wanted Xiao Zhongwu dead.

11:00.230 --> 11:01.870
I wanted him dead.

11:02.950 --> 11:04.470
My father treated you well.

11:06.150 --> 11:07.630
Why did you do that?

11:18.070 --> 11:19.710
Is there something we don't know?

11:20.070 --> 11:20.910
Feel free to speak.

11:21.430 --> 11:23.990
We'll plead your case
before His Majesty.

11:24.750 --> 11:26.190
He treated me well?

11:28.230 --> 11:29.670
That's because he felt guilty.

11:30.830 --> 11:32.550
He killed my son.

11:34.790 --> 11:36.950
My son had just reached adulthood.

11:37.910 --> 11:38.750
As far as I know,

11:39.070 --> 11:39.910
your son

11:40.270 --> 11:41.430
died on the battlefield.

11:41.950 --> 11:43.950
As a soldier, you should know

11:44.230 --> 11:45.230
that war is merciless.

11:46.150 --> 11:47.350
When soldiers march to war,

11:47.830 --> 11:49.470
they embrace death without regrets.

11:50.470 --> 11:51.550
Why would you think

11:51.550 --> 11:52.590
that General Xiao

11:52.590 --> 11:53.830
killed your son?

11:54.510 --> 11:56.670
If Xiao Zhongwu hadn't been warlike,

11:56.870 --> 11:57.710
my son

11:57.710 --> 11:59.270
wouldn't have died.

11:59.510 --> 12:01.230
If he truly died in battle,

12:01.390 --> 12:02.230
as his father,

12:02.630 --> 12:03.790
I'd be immensely proud.

12:04.310 --> 12:05.150
But he died

12:05.230 --> 12:06.790
under Xiao Zhongwu's

12:06.790 --> 12:08.430
petty schemes.

12:14.830 --> 12:15.950
You were supposed to

12:17.110 --> 12:18.670
lead the vanguard at Yanshan.

12:18.710 --> 12:19.550
Why was my son

12:19.550 --> 12:21.150
sent as the vanguard in the end?

12:21.910 --> 12:23.990
He never returned,

12:24.630 --> 12:26.190
yet you built your fame.

12:29.350 --> 12:31.430
You earned your glory by stepping

12:33.430 --> 12:35.270
on my son's corpse.

12:37.430 --> 12:38.510
I remember that battle.

12:39.550 --> 12:40.870
A total of 216

12:42.030 --> 12:43.430
Xiao Army soldiers

12:44.750 --> 12:45.990
died on the battlefield.

12:47.710 --> 12:48.750
Even though they knew

12:48.830 --> 12:49.670
before setting out

12:50.350 --> 12:51.190
that this battle

12:52.150 --> 12:53.310
would likely be fatal,

12:55.630 --> 12:57.630
they still volunteered to fight.

12:59.950 --> 13:00.830
Your son,

13:02.230 --> 13:03.550
Captain Chai Qian,

13:04.950 --> 13:05.950
was one of them.

13:09.350 --> 13:10.190
Do you know

13:10.590 --> 13:12.230
we encountered Wutuo cavalry

13:13.110 --> 13:14.630
on the way to Yanshan?

13:15.350 --> 13:16.430
With 1,000 soldiers,

13:16.430 --> 13:17.950
we fought against 5,000 enemies.

13:20.550 --> 13:22.270
I couldn't reach Yanshan in time.

13:23.470 --> 13:26.070
Your son volunteered

13:27.150 --> 13:30.310
to lead the remaining
215 Xiao Army troops

13:31.510 --> 13:32.750
to Yanshan,

13:34.150 --> 13:36.110
sacrificing themselves to turn the tide.

13:39.430 --> 13:41.430
You're lying.

13:44.710 --> 13:45.550
Mr. Chai.

13:46.110 --> 13:47.190
As a deputy general,

13:48.590 --> 13:50.310
how could you distrust the commander

13:50.870 --> 13:51.990
who had fought

13:52.030 --> 13:53.270
alongside you for years?

13:53.950 --> 13:54.990
And as a father,

13:55.870 --> 13:57.190
why did you underestimate

13:58.070 --> 13:59.950
the son you raised yourself?

14:11.190 --> 14:12.790
Here is the petition

14:13.950 --> 14:15.150
signed by

14:16.430 --> 14:17.870
all 216 Xiao Army soldiers.

14:37.690 --> 14:41.640
(Petition)

14:54.070 --> 14:55.190
Qian,

14:55.550 --> 14:57.310
you volunteered to fight?

15:01.190 --> 15:02.350
I'm sorry.

15:02.990 --> 15:04.510
I'm so sorry.

15:06.030 --> 15:07.990
I wronged General Xiao.

15:11.190 --> 15:13.510
I wronged all the soldiers

15:14.310 --> 15:16.350
of the Xiao Army.

15:27.230 --> 15:28.070
General Chai.

15:28.390 --> 15:29.470
You already regret it.

15:29.910 --> 15:31.310
Then tell us the truth.

15:32.030 --> 15:34.150
In the Mingshui Battle,
the commander died,

15:34.550 --> 15:35.950
and 30,000 soldiers perished.

15:37.110 --> 15:38.270
Was it fate

15:39.750 --> 15:40.710
or a setup?

15:42.630 --> 15:44.310
Beware of He Rufei.

15:47.390 --> 15:50.390
He told me to hold back
General Xiao's plea for help

15:52.710 --> 15:54.070
for a few days.

15:57.190 --> 15:58.310
Beware of whom?

16:01.110 --> 16:02.070
He Rufei.

16:03.670 --> 16:04.510
Mr. Chai.

16:05.870 --> 16:08.270
Was anyone else involved?

16:09.670 --> 16:11.710
I only had contact with He Rufei.

16:12.590 --> 16:15.150
But I'm sure
someone in the capital was involved.

16:16.630 --> 16:17.750
He sounded like

16:21.190 --> 16:23.470
someone highly influential.

16:30.270 --> 16:31.110
Who could be

16:31.310 --> 16:32.950
more influential than Xu Jingfu

16:34.350 --> 16:35.870
in the court?

17:14.069 --> 17:14.910
Congratulations

17:14.990 --> 17:16.150
(Li Kuang, Eight Warriors of Fuyue Army)
on being entitled General Feihong.

17:30.350 --> 17:31.870
He Rufei.

17:32.630 --> 17:33.950
It's you.

17:34.150 --> 17:35.390
In the Mingshui Battle,

17:36.070 --> 17:37.590
you made me hold back

17:37.630 --> 17:39.590
General Xiao's plea for help,

17:40.070 --> 17:41.670
killing General Xiao

17:42.390 --> 17:44.870
and 30,000 Xiao Army soldiers.

17:45.350 --> 17:47.430
No, I'm not He Rufei.

17:49.510 --> 17:50.990
You're not He Rufei?

18:28.390 --> 18:29.830
Are you He Yan

18:29.870 --> 18:31.310
or He Rufei?

18:41.350 --> 18:42.990
(Beware of He Rufei.)

18:44.990 --> 18:46.270
(He made me hold back)

18:46.310 --> 18:47.950
(General Xiao's plea for help)

18:50.150 --> 18:51.670
(for a few days.)

18:58.230 --> 19:00.150
(The "He Rufei" Chai Anxi mentioned)

19:01.150 --> 19:02.550
(should be me.)

19:04.110 --> 19:05.110
(But I never)

19:05.110 --> 19:06.190
(saw him in private.)

19:07.670 --> 19:08.790
(The one who contacted him)

19:09.390 --> 19:10.950
(must have been the real He Rufei.)

19:12.430 --> 19:13.270
(Therefore,)

19:13.750 --> 19:14.670
(He Rufei must have)

19:14.710 --> 19:16.350
(colluded with Xu Jingfu long ago.)

19:17.710 --> 19:19.710
(But why did he
scheme against the Xiao Army?)

19:20.870 --> 19:21.710
(Was my death)

19:22.350 --> 19:24.350
(also part of the scheme?)

19:36.710 --> 19:37.830
(No wonder Xiao Jue)

19:37.870 --> 19:39.110
(took the Qinglang Sword)

19:40.230 --> 19:41.270
(and was quite)

19:41.830 --> 19:43.070
(defensive against me)

19:43.110 --> 19:43.990
(at Yezhou Garrison,)

19:44.510 --> 19:45.350
(suspecting)

19:45.350 --> 19:46.630
(that I was a spy.)

19:48.230 --> 19:49.390
(But he didn't know)

19:50.550 --> 19:51.870
(that the He Rufei he knew)

19:52.350 --> 19:54.030
(was not the He Rufei)

19:54.910 --> 19:56.310
(who contacted Chai Anxi.)

20:02.430 --> 20:03.270
(Anyway,)

20:03.670 --> 20:05.030
(I must uncover the truth.)

20:05.630 --> 20:06.550
(Huaijin deserves)

20:07.310 --> 20:08.910
(an explanation.)

20:29.190 --> 20:30.430
Young Master, you're back.

20:31.750 --> 20:32.950
What did Chai Anxi say?

20:33.470 --> 20:35.910
Is Chancellor Xu
involved in the Mingshui defeat?

20:41.800 --> 20:43.670
Since you've obtained an answer,

20:43.950 --> 20:45.710
I'll kill Chai Anxi now

20:46.310 --> 20:47.390
to complete the mission.

20:48.070 --> 20:48.910
No.

20:49.750 --> 20:50.870
He can't die yet.

20:52.870 --> 20:53.710
Where's Xiao Jue?

20:54.390 --> 20:55.390
Went to see Her Highness.

20:58.750 --> 20:59.590
In that case,

21:00.470 --> 21:01.870
we should bid her farewell.

21:05.790 --> 21:08.830
I didn't expect
that you're also leaving Jiyang.

21:09.270 --> 21:10.590
Unfortunately,

21:11.110 --> 21:12.390
we're going different ways.

21:13.270 --> 21:14.430
We're bound to meet

21:15.310 --> 21:16.630
in the imperial court again.

21:19.070 --> 21:20.070
Commander's right.

21:34.150 --> 21:35.030
Why did you

21:35.670 --> 21:36.910
ask to speak in private,

21:37.910 --> 21:39.030
even without He Yan?

21:44.710 --> 21:45.590
I need

21:46.190 --> 21:48.550
your help with something.

21:49.190 --> 21:50.030
What is it?

21:50.230 --> 21:51.070
He Yan

21:51.550 --> 21:52.910
joined my ranks

21:52.950 --> 21:53.870
disguised as a man.

21:54.310 --> 21:55.230
You know best

21:55.670 --> 21:57.510
what restrictions women face.

21:58.350 --> 21:59.590
He Yan is patriotic

22:00.470 --> 22:01.630
and has military prowess.

22:02.550 --> 22:03.990
But her true identity

22:03.990 --> 22:05.390
brings unnecessary complications.

22:05.870 --> 22:06.710
Therefore,

22:07.190 --> 22:08.590
she disguised herself as a man

22:08.990 --> 22:09.870
to serve in the army.

22:10.630 --> 22:11.590
We do need to

22:12.070 --> 22:13.430
address this issue.

22:14.270 --> 22:15.310
But it's not time yet.

22:16.070 --> 22:17.230
So please help

22:18.230 --> 22:19.670
keep her secret.

22:20.350 --> 22:21.710
General Fengyun, rest assured.

22:22.190 --> 22:23.510
You saved Jiyang.

22:23.830 --> 22:24.670
We Jiyang people

22:24.910 --> 22:27.230
won't let our saviors face any trouble.

22:30.110 --> 22:30.950
Thank you.

22:33.990 --> 22:34.830
Xiao Jue.

22:39.350 --> 22:41.230
He Yan is Buwang's only disciple.

22:41.910 --> 22:43.750
Though jade needs grinding to glow,

22:44.270 --> 22:45.310
I won't allow

22:45.790 --> 22:47.510
any man to bully or hurt her.

22:48.710 --> 22:51.390
Jiyang will always be her maiden home.

23:22.830 --> 23:23.670
Don't worry.

23:23.830 --> 23:24.750
I'll keep your secret

23:24.910 --> 23:27.150
even after I go back to the capital.

23:27.710 --> 23:28.550
Thank you, Mr. Chu.

23:28.910 --> 23:30.030
What a pity that you can't

23:30.470 --> 23:31.470
take credit for this.

23:32.910 --> 23:33.910
As long as Jiyang's safe.

23:34.870 --> 23:35.710
Mr. Chu.

23:36.390 --> 23:37.230
Let's stop here.

23:38.230 --> 23:39.270
I was in the army.

23:39.590 --> 23:40.910
Night walks don't scare me.

23:42.390 --> 23:43.230
Actually,

23:43.590 --> 23:45.110
I just wanted to walk with you.

23:48.950 --> 23:50.430
You still call me "Mr. Chu."

23:50.990 --> 23:52.910
That eases my mind.

23:53.950 --> 23:55.630
I didn't know that Commander Xiao would

23:56.270 --> 23:57.190
suspect my master.

23:58.750 --> 23:59.590
By the way,

23:59.790 --> 24:00.790
Yingxiang is holding

24:00.870 --> 24:02.470
the mermaid-silk gown you gave me.

24:03.470 --> 24:05.270
She will take it to your room.

24:06.150 --> 24:06.990
Thank you.

24:07.630 --> 24:08.470
Mr. Chu.

24:08.790 --> 24:10.590
As Xu Jingfu's prized disciple,

24:11.350 --> 24:12.590
you must know

24:12.870 --> 24:14.350
more than you claim

24:14.670 --> 24:15.630
about his dealings.

24:16.510 --> 24:17.710
The real question is

24:18.150 --> 24:19.750
how involved you were.

24:20.750 --> 24:23.750
But you stood with Jiyang in crisis.

24:24.110 --> 24:24.950
I believe

24:25.190 --> 24:27.430
that you would never commit treason.

24:28.230 --> 24:30.110
I hope you'll stop working

24:30.670 --> 24:31.790
for the villain.

24:35.430 --> 24:36.590
Master is a loyal man.

24:37.470 --> 24:38.350
How can I believe

24:38.830 --> 24:40.030
that he'd frame patriots

24:40.150 --> 24:41.110
for no reason?

24:41.510 --> 24:43.110
But Chai Anxi's detailed account

24:43.990 --> 24:44.990
sowed doubts in me...

24:48.350 --> 24:49.190
Never mind.

24:49.550 --> 24:51.470
No matter what lies ahead,

24:52.190 --> 24:54.510
I seek only to act
without regret or guilt.

24:55.550 --> 24:56.510
Then I wish you

24:57.590 --> 24:58.430
a safe journey.

25:00.750 --> 25:01.590
Miss He,

25:01.870 --> 25:03.470
you truly stand apart from other women.

25:04.310 --> 25:05.150
They

25:05.710 --> 25:06.830
lack your resilience.

25:08.310 --> 25:09.270
What they desire

25:09.710 --> 25:10.710
is merely to find a match

25:10.710 --> 25:12.430
for marital bliss and peaceful living.

25:13.110 --> 25:14.550
Mr. Chu, your words

25:14.670 --> 25:15.990
sound rather condescending.

25:16.350 --> 25:17.230
How come?

25:17.990 --> 25:19.670
Men can study literature,

25:19.870 --> 25:20.950
join the military,

25:21.430 --> 25:22.830
or become physicians and merchants.

25:23.390 --> 25:24.710
Yet from birth,

25:25.270 --> 25:27.430
women are expected
to be virtuous and demure,

25:27.710 --> 25:29.110
learn needlework and etiquette,

25:29.230 --> 25:30.990
all for marital servitude
and child-rearing.

25:31.670 --> 25:33.510
Whether they want it matters not.

25:33.790 --> 25:34.630
Because all this

25:35.110 --> 25:36.470
is deemed natural and rightful.

25:39.030 --> 25:40.070
I was small-minded.

25:41.030 --> 25:41.950
Miss He,

25:42.230 --> 25:43.070
as a woman,

25:43.550 --> 25:44.950
you empathize

25:45.070 --> 25:45.950
with women's plight.

25:46.430 --> 25:47.750
You dare to pioneer paths

25:48.190 --> 25:49.270
others dare not tread.

25:49.870 --> 25:51.230
I truly admire you.

25:51.710 --> 25:53.910
You find me different

25:54.510 --> 25:55.990
because I've studied,

25:56.470 --> 25:57.510
ventured out,

25:57.910 --> 26:00.190
and even defied conventions
by joining the military,

26:00.310 --> 26:01.910
as others might call it.

26:02.430 --> 26:03.510
Yet how many women

26:03.910 --> 26:05.950
share my experiences?

26:07.310 --> 26:08.510
If they too

26:08.910 --> 26:09.830
could witness

26:10.430 --> 26:11.950
Yezhou's snows,

26:12.790 --> 26:14.270
Jiyang's waters,

26:14.870 --> 26:16.430
desert moons,

26:16.910 --> 26:18.430
and mountain ranges,

26:20.110 --> 26:20.950
tell me,

26:21.190 --> 26:22.590
would they still tolerate

26:22.830 --> 26:25.030
being confined to petty
domestic squabbles?

26:25.350 --> 26:26.990
Would they still wallow in melancholy

26:27.510 --> 26:28.510
and self-pity?

26:33.990 --> 26:35.230
I wish to blaze

26:36.070 --> 26:37.710
a different trail for you.

26:41.470 --> 26:42.350
What do you think

26:43.150 --> 26:43.990
of this proposal?

26:49.150 --> 26:49.990
I need no one

26:50.270 --> 26:51.110
to blaze a trail

26:51.430 --> 26:52.910
on my behalf.

26:53.830 --> 26:54.750
What I truly desire

26:55.310 --> 26:56.670
is someone who'll walk beside me

26:57.070 --> 26:58.110
to blaze a trail together.

27:11.030 --> 27:11.990
Then who do you think

27:12.830 --> 27:13.670
could

27:14.630 --> 27:15.990
blaze a trail with you?

27:17.230 --> 27:18.070
Could it be

27:18.510 --> 27:19.350
Commander Xiao?

27:29.390 --> 27:30.230
Commander.

27:31.710 --> 27:32.950
You came back alone

27:34.510 --> 27:35.870
just to bid him farewell?

27:46.510 --> 27:47.350
Commander.

27:48.470 --> 27:49.310
Chai Anxi

27:49.950 --> 27:50.790
is dead.

28:21.750 --> 28:23.550
We maintained
complete perimeter security

28:23.950 --> 28:24.950
without lapse.

28:25.470 --> 28:26.310
After nightfall,

28:26.410 --> 28:28.030
some cleaners passed through

28:28.630 --> 28:29.590
and suddenly attacked.

28:30.750 --> 28:31.950
We fought fiercely

28:32.550 --> 28:33.910
but failed to stop them.

28:36.590 --> 28:37.430
Commander.

28:37.550 --> 28:38.470
I've failed my duty.

28:38.750 --> 28:39.630
Please punish me.

28:44.750 --> 28:45.590
You did your best.

28:46.430 --> 28:47.710
Cheng Lisu and Song Taotao

28:48.150 --> 28:49.430
must be treating the injured.

28:50.270 --> 28:51.270
Seek their medical aid.

28:52.110 --> 28:52.950
Understood.

29:28.750 --> 29:30.190
Commander, look.

29:31.350 --> 29:33.910
This token bears Wutuo's lion emblem.

29:34.990 --> 29:35.830
These assassins

29:36.270 --> 29:37.630
could be Wutuo soldiers.

29:41.950 --> 29:42.990
Wutuo soldiers?

29:44.870 --> 29:46.670
Haven't they retreated after the defeat?

29:48.150 --> 29:48.990
Mr. Chu,

29:49.990 --> 29:51.590
you don't know anything about it?

29:51.910 --> 29:52.750
Commander Xiao.

29:52.950 --> 29:53.870
What do you mean?

29:54.790 --> 29:55.630
Haven't I been

29:56.070 --> 29:57.550
with you the whole time?

30:09.750 --> 30:11.910
Chu Zhao is Xu Jingfu's prized disciple.

30:12.510 --> 30:13.750
Are you suspecting him?

30:14.270 --> 30:16.070
The role he has played in this

30:16.710 --> 30:17.590
remains unclear.

30:18.830 --> 30:20.390
But mobilizing Wutuo troops

30:21.230 --> 30:22.790
is beyond his current capabilities.

30:24.630 --> 30:25.470
Commander.

30:26.790 --> 30:27.630
Come in.

30:31.350 --> 30:32.190
Commander.

30:32.350 --> 30:33.190
I'm back.

30:33.870 --> 30:34.710
Commander.

30:34.710 --> 30:35.870
I've been thinking.

30:36.310 --> 30:37.430
We can't just let it slide.

30:38.310 --> 30:39.390
Shall we rush

30:39.790 --> 30:41.310
to the capital to confront Xu Jingfu?

30:42.390 --> 30:43.430
How can we confront him

30:43.830 --> 30:44.670
without

30:45.270 --> 30:46.150
our key witness?

30:47.190 --> 30:48.030
But

30:48.390 --> 30:49.750
we have some other leads.

30:51.110 --> 30:52.350
At least, we've confirmed

30:53.230 --> 30:54.110
that He Rufei

30:54.910 --> 30:56.270
was indeed involved.

30:57.190 --> 30:58.590
Xu Jingfu is a cunning old fox.

30:59.230 --> 31:00.070
Then let's

31:00.590 --> 31:01.990
look into He Rufei.

31:02.710 --> 31:03.910
Find out how those two

31:04.510 --> 31:05.350
were connected

31:05.630 --> 31:06.470
before Mingshui.

31:06.550 --> 31:07.390
Understood.

31:07.710 --> 31:08.550
No wonder Mr. Cheng

31:08.550 --> 31:09.430
keeps calling

31:09.430 --> 31:10.630
He Rufei ungrateful.

31:11.150 --> 31:12.830
General Xiao treated him so well

31:13.150 --> 31:14.710
and gifted him the Qinglang Sword.

31:15.750 --> 31:16.590
But in the end,

31:16.950 --> 31:17.830
he betrayed us.

31:27.670 --> 31:28.550
Anything else?

31:29.310 --> 31:30.150
If not,

31:30.830 --> 31:31.670
I'll take my leave.

31:44.190 --> 31:45.030
Young Master.

31:45.510 --> 31:47.230
Who sent those assassins?

31:49.070 --> 31:49.950
Master, naturally.

31:51.230 --> 31:52.310
I delayed taking action.

31:52.630 --> 31:53.950
Master ran out of patience

31:53.950 --> 31:54.990
and sent assassins.

31:55.950 --> 31:56.910
All I had to do

31:57.350 --> 31:59.270
was to stay out of it.

31:59.830 --> 32:01.110
So I went to see Her Highness

32:01.230 --> 32:02.390
to establish an alibi.

32:07.910 --> 32:09.310
(But the truth must also surface.)

32:10.030 --> 32:11.270
So I left behind evidence

32:11.270 --> 32:12.150
to guide Xiao Jue.

32:13.230 --> 32:14.230
Just like that,

32:14.630 --> 32:16.390
Xiao Jue will suspect Chancellor Xu.

32:16.750 --> 32:18.150
But he is in the capital.

32:19.110 --> 32:20.790
Wouldn't Xiao Jue suspect

32:21.190 --> 32:23.350
that you did it
on behalf of the Chancellor?

32:23.390 --> 32:24.230
No, he wouldn't.

32:25.110 --> 32:26.470
Xiao Jue knows full well

32:26.950 --> 32:29.270
that Master would never
hand me evidence of colluding

32:29.670 --> 32:30.550
with Wutuo people.

32:31.150 --> 32:32.350
So, I couldn't possibly

32:32.390 --> 32:33.350
mobilize Wutuo troops.

32:33.870 --> 32:35.550
Even without Chai Anxi's testimony,

32:36.390 --> 32:37.830
Xiao Jue will find other means

32:38.430 --> 32:39.270
to fight Master

32:39.950 --> 32:41.190
and He Rufei to the end.

32:41.990 --> 32:43.350
A pity indeed for Chai Anxi,

32:44.030 --> 32:45.270
once a valiant warrior,

32:45.830 --> 32:46.990
now brought to such an end.

32:47.950 --> 32:48.790
Young Master.

32:48.990 --> 32:50.710
Chai Anxi was killed by Wutuo soldiers.

32:51.870 --> 32:53.310
Will Chancellor Xu blame you

32:53.550 --> 32:54.830
for failing his orders?

32:55.510 --> 32:58.310
Gain and loss must balance.
Only thus endures.

32:59.230 --> 33:00.470
Had I followed his orders,

33:01.070 --> 33:02.430
we'd miss the secrets.

33:03.430 --> 33:04.270
These secrets

33:04.870 --> 33:06.470
and Sun Xiangfu's ledger

33:07.550 --> 33:09.110
prove that Master has betrayed Wei.

33:13.020 --> 33:15.690
(Cui Mansion)

33:17.270 --> 33:18.470
Commander Xiao, Miss He.

33:18.950 --> 33:20.390
Mr. Cheng, Miss Song.

33:20.910 --> 33:21.870
Take care.

33:22.870 --> 33:23.710
I don't know

33:23.950 --> 33:24.870
when we'll meet again.

33:25.470 --> 33:27.470
You repelled the Wutuo army

33:27.750 --> 33:28.750
and saved us.

33:29.430 --> 33:30.270
We appreciate it.

33:30.270 --> 33:32.940
(Great Virtue)

33:42.870 --> 33:43.710
Yan.

33:43.870 --> 33:45.830
We'll pass through Chonghuai.

33:45.990 --> 33:47.070
Shall we make a stop

33:47.150 --> 33:48.430
and have fun for a few days?

33:51.520 --> 33:53.930
(Wangjiang House)

33:56.510 --> 33:57.910
Passing through Chonghuai,

33:58.350 --> 33:59.830
I finally get to see

33:59.910 --> 34:01.390
the renowned Wangjiang House.

34:01.830 --> 34:02.670
Did you bring

34:02.790 --> 34:03.710
enough money?

34:04.190 --> 34:05.350
You wanted to come.

34:05.430 --> 34:06.470
So, you're paying.

34:07.190 --> 34:09.230
I suggested this trip to lift spirits

34:09.710 --> 34:11.150
because Mr. He seemed troubled.

34:11.389 --> 34:12.230
Once He cheers up,

34:12.630 --> 34:13.469
Huaijin

34:13.550 --> 34:14.469
will be happy too.

34:18.670 --> 34:20.110
This place looks pricey.

34:20.750 --> 34:21.670
Thank you, Mr. Cheng.

34:22.030 --> 34:22.870
No problem.

34:23.310 --> 34:24.150
Besides,

34:24.150 --> 34:25.190
we can all chip in

34:25.389 --> 34:26.389
if my money runs short.

34:26.750 --> 34:28.429
Just like back at Ruyun House.

34:28.670 --> 34:29.750
Right, Huaijin?

34:30.510 --> 34:31.429
Leave me out of this.

34:32.310 --> 34:34.150
The famous Ruyun House in the capital?

34:34.600 --> 34:35.600
Why did you visit

34:35.600 --> 34:36.590
without me?

34:36.590 --> 34:38.110
Why would we take you?

34:38.150 --> 34:38.989
You were just a kid.

34:39.110 --> 34:40.190
How old were you?

34:41.350 --> 34:42.190
(Guys,)

34:42.630 --> 34:44.389
have you heard of Ruyun House?

34:45.429 --> 34:47.110
Yaojing's biggest brothel.

34:47.469 --> 34:48.310
I've been there.

34:48.389 --> 34:49.230
It's overrated.

34:50.310 --> 34:52.670
Young Master Yan is so experienced.

34:53.270 --> 34:54.110
Of course.

34:57.870 --> 34:58.820
You've been there?

35:00.110 --> 35:00.950
No.

35:01.550 --> 35:02.390
I lied.

35:03.990 --> 35:04.830
Huaijin.

35:04.910 --> 35:05.790
You woke up?

35:06.510 --> 35:07.470
I heard Ruyun House

35:07.510 --> 35:08.630
has a new songstress

35:08.790 --> 35:09.910
named Hua Youxian.

35:10.470 --> 35:11.870
Her stunning look

35:12.070 --> 35:13.310
and heavenly voice

35:13.830 --> 35:15.510
made her the top performer in a month.

35:15.950 --> 35:16.910
Let's go hear her sing

35:17.230 --> 35:18.230
after class.

35:18.430 --> 35:19.350
Do you dare?

35:20.110 --> 35:21.430
It's your turn now.

35:21.590 --> 35:22.470
Tell you what...

35:23.070 --> 35:23.910
Forget about Yan He.

35:24.310 --> 35:25.230
He will brag about it

35:25.350 --> 35:26.190
either way.

35:26.470 --> 35:27.310
Let's go.

35:27.830 --> 35:29.030
Only cowards back out.

35:29.990 --> 35:31.150
He Rufei, you hear me?

35:33.710 --> 35:34.550
Me too?

35:35.190 --> 35:36.030
Let's go.

35:36.350 --> 35:37.190
With the top student

35:37.190 --> 35:38.150
Xiao Huaijin with us,

35:38.390 --> 35:39.950
we won't be punished too harshly

35:40.030 --> 35:41.350
even if we get caught.

35:41.990 --> 35:42.830
Let's go.

35:43.870 --> 35:44.750
Let's go.

35:44.870 --> 35:45.710
Come on.

35:46.070 --> 35:47.150
How do we sneak out?

35:47.830 --> 35:48.670
He Rufei.

35:49.430 --> 35:50.270
Keep up.

35:50.310 --> 35:51.150
Don't be a coward.

35:57.550 --> 35:58.390
Climb over here.

36:03.310 --> 36:04.150
Careful.

36:05.070 --> 36:06.190
- Thanks.
- Let's go.

36:07.430 --> 36:08.270
Someone's missing.

36:09.190 --> 36:10.030
Where's He Rufei?

36:10.630 --> 36:11.870
I'm here.

36:18.390 --> 36:19.670
Pathetic.

36:34.390 --> 36:35.470
Thank you.

36:36.110 --> 36:36.950
You can't even

36:37.350 --> 36:38.190
climb the wall?

36:38.790 --> 36:39.870
I didn't want to come.

36:40.510 --> 36:41.350
Yan He

36:41.390 --> 36:42.510
dragged me along.

36:44.910 --> 36:45.750
Also,

36:45.950 --> 36:47.590
aren't you, the top student,

36:48.070 --> 36:49.630
also sneaking off to the brothel?

36:53.990 --> 36:54.830
What's wrong?

36:59.030 --> 36:59.910
Ruyun House

37:00.670 --> 37:01.990
has long intrigued me.

37:03.350 --> 37:04.190
Yan.

37:05.270 --> 37:06.630
You don't look well.

37:06.750 --> 37:08.110
Didn't you sleep well?

37:09.590 --> 37:10.430
It's fine.

37:10.790 --> 37:12.950
It's just some memories resurfacing.

37:13.630 --> 37:15.150
Is it about Mr. Liu?

37:16.230 --> 37:18.030
I-I'll stop.

37:24.270 --> 37:25.870
Ruyun House is fascinating.

37:26.390 --> 37:27.230
Huaijin.

37:27.350 --> 37:28.550
Remember our old friends?

37:38.360 --> 37:42.730
(Wangjiang House)

37:57.790 --> 37:58.630
Cheng Lisu.

37:59.430 --> 38:00.550
This is...?

38:00.870 --> 38:01.710
Huaijin.

38:01.830 --> 38:03.150
You remember Yang Mingzhi?

38:05.310 --> 38:07.660
(Yang Mingzhi, Magistrate of Chonghuai)

38:11.430 --> 38:12.430
I'm Yang Mingzhi.

38:13.070 --> 38:14.150
Greetings, General Fengyun.

38:22.710 --> 38:24.910
Mingzhi now serves
as Chonghuai's Magistrate.

38:25.310 --> 38:26.390
We were classmates.

38:26.630 --> 38:28.310
So I invited him here to catch up.

38:34.110 --> 38:35.950
Are they enemies or something?

38:37.110 --> 38:39.070
Back at Xianchang Academy,

38:39.470 --> 38:40.950
they were close friends.

38:41.430 --> 38:42.270
Yang Mingzhi

38:42.270 --> 38:44.230
is the only son
of the current Minister of War.

38:44.790 --> 38:46.270
He passed the exams years ago,

38:46.510 --> 38:47.350
yet somehow ended up

38:47.350 --> 38:48.990
as a lowly magistrate in Chonghuai.

38:49.670 --> 38:50.550
Why are they acting

38:50.630 --> 38:51.750
like strangers now?

38:52.070 --> 38:53.030
I'm also curious.

38:55.190 --> 38:56.030
Gentlemen,

38:56.230 --> 38:57.390
fate brought us together

38:57.550 --> 38:58.430
at the academy.

38:58.550 --> 39:00.230
Cleared up your misunderstandings.

39:00.230 --> 39:01.070
Cheng Lisu,

39:01.430 --> 39:02.270
you may not know.

39:03.990 --> 39:05.470
There is no misunderstanding

39:06.590 --> 39:07.630
between us.

39:13.390 --> 39:14.230
Huaijin.

39:14.830 --> 39:15.670
Rest assured.

39:16.670 --> 39:17.830
I'll convince my father

39:17.910 --> 39:19.390
to plead for General Xiao

39:19.950 --> 39:20.990
and urge His Majesty

39:20.990 --> 39:22.030
to find out the truth.

39:23.470 --> 39:24.790
As the Minister of War,

39:25.430 --> 39:26.350
my father

39:26.790 --> 39:28.350
has certain influence.

39:29.310 --> 39:30.150
Mingzhi.

39:31.710 --> 39:32.550
Thank you.

39:33.430 --> 39:35.350
Xiao Zhongwu, as the commander-in-chief,

39:35.750 --> 39:36.790
was reckless,

39:37.190 --> 39:39.110
leading our troops into an ambush.

39:39.390 --> 39:40.470
He was too proud

39:40.990 --> 39:42.350
to seek prompt rescue,

39:42.910 --> 39:45.630
which caused huge casualties.

39:46.030 --> 39:46.870
Xiao Zhongwu

39:46.910 --> 39:48.430
is a sinner to Wei.

39:49.080 --> 39:51.390
(Xiao Mansion)

39:51.390 --> 39:52.230
Huaijin.

39:52.910 --> 39:53.830
I broke my promise.

39:55.230 --> 39:56.070
Sorry.

39:58.390 --> 40:00.110
I forced this burden on you.

40:01.190 --> 40:02.270
No need to apologize.

40:03.790 --> 40:05.870
I heard you volunteered
to go to Que City.

40:08.590 --> 40:10.310
Word travels fast, it seems.

40:10.710 --> 40:11.550
Are you insane?

40:14.830 --> 40:16.950
I know you want to
restore honor to your father

40:16.950 --> 40:17.830
and the Xiao Army.

